      "id": 492776,
      "username": "thainhatoi",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2026-01-29T03:32:21.844Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thank you for your detailed reply!</p>\n<p>I tried to do delete everything about routing and start from zero, but no luck for me. If it doesn’t bother you too much, I would like to describe what I’m doing in more details. After I delete all things related to Manufacturing lead time and Capacity, I got 0 lead time in MRP report <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/frowning.png?v=14\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>When I talked about <strong>“Item lead time”</strong>, I was referring about <strong>“Item lead time form”</strong>, which includes Manufacturing and Purchasing lead time in it, as shown in images below</p>\n<p>When I input data into <strong>“Purchase time”</strong>, the <strong>“Lead time”</strong> change immediately in MRP report (as shown as 12 in the image)</p>\n<p>However, as described before, when I input data into <strong>“Manufacturing time”</strong>, it will only show 1 for Lead time in MRP report. If I delete all data in <strong>“Manufacturing time”</strong>, it will show as 0 lead time.</p>\n<p>I think I have done the routing completely, it even shows lead time as 13 in <strong>Demand tab</strong> in “<strong>Master Production Schedule”</strong></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/8/b85059f38fa6cb656c4ca1df32ed1db819239a78.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b85059f38fa6cb656c4ca1df32ed1db819239a78\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/8/b85059f38fa6cb656c4ca1df32ed1db819239a78_2_690x469.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"qiw0pjjmEKYBGTfwIccybkKtHzq\" width=\"690\" height=\"469\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/8/b85059f38fa6cb656c4ca1df32ed1db819239a78_2_690x469.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/8/b85059f38fa6cb656c4ca1df32ed1db819239a78.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/8/b85059f38fa6cb656c4ca1df32ed1db819239a78.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1000×680 42.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>P/s: I can only send 1 image as new user <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/frowning.png?v=14\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
